# Arena IRICE-TEST 1920x1080 scale 1, the user's config (expressive motion, Colloid, their 4 widgets).
# Each file runs top to bottom from a fresh desktop. `static NAME x y w h`: that region must not change
# from there until the next `shot`, `rec` or `look` (the no-reload blocks end with their last close).
# Right-clicks: `ptr ... down up` lines marked (right button) need the runner's right button.

look glass
note no reload: widgets must not fade or grow in again while windows open, focus and close (only the clock's minute may change)
ptr move 1500 600
shot dw-before
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot dw-after-open-1
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot dw-after-open-2
note the after-open shots equal the before shot over the widgets (no widget at 0.9 scale or faded)
static dw-clock 32 54 344 164
static dw-stack 32 234 344 164
static dw-batteries 32 414 344 164
static dw-shortcuts 392 54 344 164
ptr move 1300 700 click
wait 1
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
ptr move 600 600 glide 200 300 300 sleep 200
note (right button, manual) right-click the stack at 200,300:
note right-click on the stack: sizes with ✓, kinds, Smart Rotate, Widget Options…, Edit Widgets…, Remove Widget (red); opens at the pointer, downward
key -k Escape
wait 0.5
note right-click the bare desktop at 1200 400: Edit Widgets…, Change Wallpaper…, ✓ Use Stacks, Show Files on Desktop, Desktop Settings…
ptr move 1200 400
key -k Escape
wait 0.3
rec dw-edit 1.0 ipc panels widgets true
note editing: faint cells fade in ≈220 ms, each widget's − badge springs in with a small overshoot
ipc panels widgets false
wait 0.5
rec dw-drag 3 ptr move 600 130 down glide 600 330 400 glide 1000 330 400 up
note the shortcuts widget follows after 6 px, grows 1.04, ghost springs cell to cell; on release springs into the cell (~450 ms) and config desktop.widgets has it moved
ptr move 1000 300 down glide 600 130 400 up
wait 1
shot dw-after
setup python3 -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('desktop',{})['widgets']=json.loads('[\"clock:m:0:0\", \"stack:m:0:1:pz3mh8\", \"batteries:m:0:2\", \"shortcuts:m:2:0:5a2cav\"]');json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 1

look material
note no reload: widgets must not fade or grow in again while windows open, focus and close (only the clock's minute may change)
ptr move 1500 600
shot dw-before
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot dw-after-open-1
setup sh -c "foot & sleep 0.8; hyprctl dispatch \"hl.dsp.window.move({ workspace = 'special:parity', follow = false, window = 'class:foot' })\""
shot dw-after-open-2
note the after-open shots equal the before shot over the widgets (no widget at 0.9 scale or faded)
static dw-clock 32 54 344 164
static dw-stack 32 234 344 164
static dw-batteries 32 414 344 164
static dw-shortcuts 392 54 344 164
ptr move 1300 700 click
wait 1
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
setup hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.window.close({ window = "class:foot" })'
wait 1.5
ptr move 600 600 glide 200 300 300 sleep 200
note (right button, manual) right-click the stack at 200,300:
note right-click on the stack: sizes with ✓, kinds, Smart Rotate, Widget Options…, Edit Widgets…, Remove Widget (red); opens at the pointer, downward
key -k Escape
wait 0.5
note right-click the bare desktop at 1200 400: Edit Widgets…, Change Wallpaper…, ✓ Use Stacks, Show Files on Desktop, Desktop Settings…
ptr move 1200 400
key -k Escape
wait 0.3
rec dw-edit 1.0 ipc panels widgets true
note editing: faint cells fade in ≈220 ms, each widget's − badge springs in with a small overshoot
ipc panels widgets false
wait 0.5
rec dw-drag 3 ptr move 600 130 down glide 600 330 400 glide 1000 330 400 up
note the shortcuts widget follows after 6 px, grows 1.04, ghost springs cell to cell; on release springs into the cell (~450 ms) and config desktop.widgets has it moved
ptr move 1000 300 down glide 600 130 400 up
wait 1
shot dw-after
setup python3 -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('desktop',{})['widgets']=json.loads('[\"clock:m:0:0\", \"stack:m:0:1:pz3mh8\", \"batteries:m:0:2\", \"shortcuts:m:2:0:5a2cav\"]');json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 1
